WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.568
Top left: the connection. Green "Connected": everything is on the server.

2
00:00:02.618 --> 00:00:08.359
Tap it for the details: server, relay, database, cloud sync.

3
00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:15.409
The connection drops? Keep scoring. Every change is saved on this device.

4
00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:22.572
"waiting": changes not on the server yet.

5
00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:25.103
The connection is back: they are sent by themselves.

6
00:00:25.153 --> 00:00:31.415
On Home, the match shows its state: "Scoring here".

7
00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:34.251
"On another device": another device scores this match now.

8
00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:39.421
"Continue match" opens it read-only, with "Take back scoring here".
